WEBVTT

00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:15,380
I received my model of clear hist and clear CV today and see that they both been reformulated.

00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:20,420
Can you tell me about the changes and why they were done?

00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:28,260
So the clear CV, we wanted to add vitamin A to it because the synergistic effects of

00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:35,500
those things for clear CV to help with with colds and viruses, it was just missing vitamin

00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,420
A. So we switched it to add vitamin A.

00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,860
So that's really the only difference of clear CV.

00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:48,940
The clear hist formula is a little bit different because we just went to, we switched to a

00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:55,220
different company with that that I was happier with the total product itself.

00:00:55,220 --> 00:01:01,580
So the clear hist there's more, it's a similar product but there's more changes to it.

00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:07,460
I just think it's a much better product or always just searching to give you the best products

00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:12,180
and especially products that have our names on it, we want the best product out there.

